This quiz acts as a comprehensive review, blending fundamental control methods, specific M-codes, and a practical coordinate plotting question!

Here is the breakdown of the new questions:

Q1 (Control Methods): The three fundamental control methods in CNC are Positioning (위치결정), Straight Cutting (직선절삭), and Contouring/Continuous (윤곽/연속절삭). "Plane cutting control" (평면절삭 제어) is not a standard distinct control category.

Q2 (Spindle Rotation): This is a direct recall question. M03 commands the spindle to rotate in the normal/forward (Clockwise/CW) direction (주축 정회전).

Q3 (Subprograms): To call a subprogram (보조 프로그램 호출), the M98 command is used. (M99 is used to return from a subprogram).

Q4 (Coordinate Plotting): The diagram shows the tool moving from a Start Point (시점) at (X30,Y10) to an End Point (종점) at (X15,Y20).

The question asks for the Absolute Command (절대지령).

Absolute commands use G90 and simply state the target destination coordinates.

Therefore, the correct command is G90 G01 X15.0 Y20.0 F100;.

